title: "symbolic_regression_signalling"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline for discovering coarse-grained models of intracellular signalling
  dynamics by symbolic regression: synthetic enzyme-kinetics benchmarks, data
  degradation experiments, and symbolic-regression and sparse neural ODE models
  of ERK phosphorylation across cancer-relevant overexpression contexts.
